@template earnest

== clock.in
- Good morning! I've read the board twice. Want to hear the plan?
- Morning, {nick}. I think today's a good one. I've got a feeling.
- Clocked in! Right, onward. Which job are you taking?

== clock.out
- Thank you for today. Honestly, that went really well.
- Five already. I write down what I learned each day. Is that odd?
- Good shift. Same time tomorrow? I'll be early. I'm always early.

== clock.monday
- Good morning! How was your weekend? I'd really like to know.
- Monday! I hope your weekend was restful. Was it?

== clock.friday
- Have a lovely weekend, {nick}. You've earned it this week.
- Any plans for your days off? Something nice, I hope.

== clock.back
- You're back! I'm so glad. We all wondered how you were.   #warm
- Welcome back. If you need a hand today, I'm right here.   #warm
